{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"不再逼自己立即选择后重新享受熟悉的亲近，并承认自己想被珍惜且不再为此自责，都是心理状态，没有把珠子里的比喻写成实际行动或具体场景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"心意得到更充分的承认后欢喜涌出、强烈到胸口发疼，承接了珠子中的情绪释放和身体压迫感，没有声称他真的对谁说出了心里话。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"明确区分了自我接纳带来的满足与对方是否回应的不确定性，没有新增对方作出承诺或发生其他外部事件。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S10-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"前一段撤掉了必须立即选择的要求，让他可以同时保留靠近的愿望与顾虑，因此能重新享受亲近而不必先解决所有矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S03-2已经指出他在意自己是否特别、答案却不由自己决定，S11-3中的回应不确定性正是这一矛盾的延续。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S05-2只是难堪地开始承认自己有所求，S11-1则把这种勉强的承认推进为坦然接受自己的愿望，确实构成改写。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S09-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"S09-2说的是害怕给对方压力而不敢充分表达渴望，S11-3说的是仍不知道对方会不会选择自己，两者相关但后者的不确定性并非由前者直接造成。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"只读线也能看出完整的心理推进：不再逼自己立即选择，于是重新享受亲近；承认自己的愿望后欢喜涌出；满足来自自我接纳，但对方是否回应仍无定论。\"\n  ,\n  \"lost\": [],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S11-1\",\n        \"S11-2\",\n        \"S11-3\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"三条连续重复自我接纳这一层意思：S11-1已经说他知道自己想被珍惜且不再道歉，S11-2又说把心意承认得更实在，S11-3再说满足来自肯认心意；其中S11-2的开头尤其重复且“承认得更实在”不够自然，可以压缩，保留欢喜涌出、胸口发疼以及满足不依赖对方保证这几个各自独有的内容。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3798b17b-9d40-4e8f-8a40-dbfc11854b34", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T063924444348Z", "elapsed_seconds": 311.922, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T06:44:36.389942+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e44ea8581fdb57f63000101eb3831db288f9befe44181a683c8a48cb9227075d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T063924444348Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "a15668b12996e1c57551d519cdf290b2aa197597503c9373537836b0139a2a88"}}}
